size:11px;color:#2C7BBF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;safe to change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#E3F1FB;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#173A5E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="719" width="128" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-77" value="What the model actually sees (the envelope, abridged)" style="rounded=0;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=17;fontColor=#173A5E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="818" width="900" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-78" value='&lt;span style="font-family:Courier New;font-size:12px;color:#173A5E"&gt;Remaining 30-day concession headroom: ₹500&lt;br&gt;Offer decisions (eligible is not approved; follow these):&lt;br&gt;- late-fee waiver (KB02): OFFER. Eligible, and ₹100 fits the ₹500 headroom.&lt;br&gt;- retention offer (KB11): NEEDS APPROVAL. Eligible, but ₹750 is above the ₹500 headroom (policy 8).&lt;br&gt;- double payment refund (KB04): AUTOMATIC. Eligible: duplicate payment of ₹1499 on record; …&lt;br&gt;Ontology-linked KB articles: KB11, …&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#F5FAFE;strokeColor=#B9D7EE;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#173A5E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="852" width="960" height="116" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-79" value='&lt;b&gt;The split that makes it work&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#3E6489"&gt;The &lt;b&gt;graph&lt;/b&gt; answers &lt;i&gt;what is true and allowed&lt;/i&gt;. The &lt;b&gt;model&lt;/b&gt; answers &lt;i&gt;how to say it&lt;/i&gt;. The &lt;b&gt;checks&lt;/b&gt; make sure the two agree before anything is sent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#7A97B3"&gt;Every escalation records its reason: rule, tool, model, guard or offer.&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#E3F1FB;strokeColor=#8EC1E6;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=16;fontColor=#173A5E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="852" width="620" height="116" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>